        PostcardNarrative(id: "xiaoman_hamster_care10_01_010", animalKey: "xiaoman_hamster", careCategory: .nightCare, body: "哪怕只放下一点点，也算放下了。小满想把这句话写给你：你不是非要一直撑得很满。"),
